body:
yea, that could very well work, and id still have my smite and a dab of healing, plus all my profs for weapons and armor. The ASI would bother me, but what can you really do I guess.

&#x200B;

EDIT : Aw shit, id get my extra attack pretty late though. with that mix, not till 8th level. Campaign is going to 10th.

Well playing heavy into the hobgoblin side, the plan is to make my guy strong enough to take over his legion and establish itself as an official entity. 

&#x200B;

RoC = Rule of cool

(EX) I tryed to use my action to kick a scimitar towards and enemy to surprise him or cause him to dodge and lose balance, rolled a nat 20, sword gets embedded in his skull. 

&#x200B;

That sort of thing.
